    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L08-ACTIVITY-010",
      "SourceSection": "8.3: Successive Splitting",
      "SourceExcerpt": "In a lab, a colony of 100 bacteria is placed on a petri dish. The population triples every hour.",
