    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L08-ACTIVITY-014",
      "SourceSection": "8.3: Successive Splitting",
      "SourceExcerpt": "A $1,000 investment increases in value by 5% each year. About how many years does it take for the value of the investment to double? Explain how you know.",
